umul-f: x * y, for x and y from 0 to 999 with x * y <= 999.
Cells 60-98. To call it, put y in cell 96, load x into the accumulator and JMP 60.
It returns x * y in the accumulator.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99, including y in cell 96 (divided down to 0).
Size 39 cells. It runs at most 84 instructions, 44.0 on average, counted from cell 60 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

